text and create the 6"x9" pdf (which I made available on the wiki) to send
to Lulu.

Sadly "la .alis." is much more complex to typeset, even if I start doing
myself, I doubt I will ever compete it: too much time needed.

 I really can't stand reading from the wiki page, even if, in the case of
"la .alis." a lot of effort have been spent to make it nicer to the eye. A
printed book would have been nice.

